---
description: Maintain the LinearKnot project notebook PDF after experiments and conclusions
alwaysApply: true
---

At the end of every task that runs an experiment, changes code or
flags, or reaches a conclusion, update docs/notebook/
linearknot_notebook.tex: add or update the experiment entry
(question, binary path, commit, branch, full flag dump, sequences,
numbers, conclusion, output directory), update the status, the
paper setting, the open questions and the next steps if they
changed, bump the minor version, and add a changelog line. Rebuild
the PDF and commit the .tex and the PDF together. Never fill a gap
from memory: if a fact is not in a file, log, commit or command
output, leave it as \tofill{...}. Keep the house style: no em
dashes, math in black, define every symbol, first-person 'we'.
